sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant MasterOrchestrator
    participant IntentRouter
    participant ApprovalGate
    participant SpecificOrchestrator
    participant AuditLogger
    
    User->>MasterOrchestrator: Request
    MasterOrchestrator->>IntentRouter: Classify Intent (LENS)
    IntentRouter-->>MasterOrchestrator: Intent Type + Confidence
    MasterOrchestrator->>ApprovalGate: Check Complexity
    ApprovalGate-->>MasterOrchestrator: Approval (Yes/No/Conditional)
    MasterOrchestrator->>AuditLogger: AC_START
    MasterOrchestrator->>SpecificOrchestrator: Execute
    SpecificOrchestrator-->>MasterOrchestrator: Result
    MasterOrchestrator->>AuditLogger: AC_COMPLETE
    MasterOrchestrator-->>User: Response